        "## 3. Basic Image Functions\n",
        "**Task:**\n",
        "1. Load `park.jpg`.\n",
        "2. Convert it to grayscale.\n",
        "3. Apply Gaussian Blur with a $(7,7)$ kernel.\n",
        "4. Perform Canny Edge detection on the blurred image.\n"
      ]
